<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 30 bln Skr of 7-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 30 bln Skr of 7-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday it will auction 30 billion crowns of Treasury bills which will mature on April 2.</p>
<p>Bids for the March 26 auction are due by 1000 GMT on March 25. The lowest accepted bid volume is 100 million crowns. The T-bills will cover six interest days.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
